<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 263)</h2>
<p><b>Web Review is live at review.byautonomy.com.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Share to Web links now mint under <b>review.byautonomy.com</b> — the page, the live session and the media all served from the studio's own domain.</li>
<li><b>End Review works any time</b> — including days later from a reopened session; the share key now survives relaunches and is destroyed when the review ends.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
